        <senderName>NWS Charleston WV</senderName>
        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued August 6 at 7:30PM EDT by NWS Charleston WV</headline>
        <description>Locations impacted include...
Trammel and Nora.

2 inches of rain has fallen and will cause creeks and streams to
rise near bankfull. This will cause ponding of water on roadways and
water problems in low-lying areas and areas with poor drainage.

Motorists should be prepared for water on roadways. Do not drive
your vehicle through flooded roadways.
</description>
