        <description>At 643 PM CDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near
Bridgeport, moving south at 10 mph.

HAZARD...Wind gusts in excess of 30 mph.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around
unsecured objects.

Locations impacted include...
Bridgeport, Ider, Fabius, Higdon, Sulpher Springs, and Long Island.
</description>
        <instruction>If outdoors, consider seeking shelter inside a building.</instruction>
